Service resource version 1.
Package customers_service.
Target rust-resource-service.v1.
Resource Customer.
Field name of Customer is string required min 1 max 100.
Field email of Customer is string required min 3 max 254.
Field country of Customer is string required upper_letters 3.
Field tier of Customer is enum required values standard silver gold.
Field loyalty_points of Customer is integer required min 0.
Field note of Customer is string optional max 500.
Apply CRUD to Customer.
Apply standard pagination to Customer.
